00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.990
Well, I was searching for Metarex secrets...

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.820
But I think they found out what I was doing.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:41.830
Dr. Eggman, a Metarex spaceship is coming!

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.950
They seem threatening!

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:46.410
This is the predicament I'm in.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:49.790
I don't have much time, so I'll get right to the point.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:54.800
Space coordinates double triple 0 is their destination.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:59.840
"When the sleeping land meets the dawn, it will be purified in a haze."

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:08.560
I don't know what that means, but something occurs once every thousand years at Planet Aquarius, located at those coordinates.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:11.690
The Metarex have been waiting for this event.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:16.820
But you shouldn't make the mistake of going there because it's dangerous.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:24.910
The Metarex attacked after this.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:28.410
The mothership caught Dr. Eggman and the peons.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.190
Peons

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.500
I barely escaped with my life!

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.880
Bokkun, what are those numbers on the monitor?

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.680
It's been such a long time that I forgot!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.520
Everyone, get ready!

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.600
You idiots!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:51.520
You're the idiot!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.980
That hurt, you idiot!

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.530
Don't cry, idiot!

00:02:55.710 --> 00:03:00.760
Episode 75

00:02:55.710 --> 00:03:00.760
The Day of the Forestations

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.040
There's nothing here.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.540
You think so?

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.370
Ta-daa!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:27.270
I had a second bridge ready, just in case.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:30.310
Does this hunk of junk still fly?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:35.190
Its overall capabilities are down, but it still works.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.780
Blue Typhoon, taking off!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.310
Shadow...

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:10.680
Are you worried about Shadow, Chris?

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.600
He has his own way of doing things.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.770
Let's give it our all, like always!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.480
Right, Sonic.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.780
That's settled.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:23.240
We're gonna beat your tribe up!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.990
Prepare yourself, Dark Oak!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.740
Sonic, take it easy. You'll upset Cosmo.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.660
I'm fine, Knuckles.

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:35.880
Oh my, you're being nice to a lady. Your flirting skills are improving.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.840
You have the wrong idea.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:40.090
You mean you want to flirt with a different girl instead?

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.920
Not you too!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:45.970
Don't laugh! It's not funny!

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:48.510
Stop laughing!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.350
Wait, Cosmo.

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:59.400
If I stay with you in the upcoming battle, I'll only get in your way.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:03.780
This will be the final battle against the Metarex.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:07.110
I want you to watch everything that's going to happen.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:12.910
And when it's over, I want you to live with us on our planet.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.580
Thank you, Tails.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:21.090
Igniting the third engine! Increasing speed!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.970
Can you see this, Dark Oak?

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.230
I have total confidence.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:38.100
No one can take away their free spirit.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:42.730
As long as they're around, you will never achieve your goals.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.620
Those fools.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.040
Multiple enemy fighters ahead!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.540
Space coordinates double triple 0!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.210
It's showtime!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:57.600
Blue Typhoon, full speed ahead! The target is Dark Oak's mothership!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.770
Roger!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.650
They're here.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.650
It's finally time.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.360
Dark Oak!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:16.410
This will be the final battle for tranquility and order in the universe.

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.710
Give it your all, Narcissus!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.080
I know.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.590
It's two of the four Metarex bosses!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:28.970
They'll be worthy opponents!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.590
Sonic Fighters, launch!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:33.890
Roger!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.700
It's party time!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:59.620
Got it!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.090
That's cheating!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.970
Laser Cannon!

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.730
Knuckles and Rouge, go to the flight deck!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:35.240
How should I look when I fight?

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.160
Let's go, bat girl!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.530
I know!

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:41.290
How long are you going to stare at yourself in the mirror?

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:46.000
What an ugly pair.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.000
What? I'm absolutely beautiful!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.960
Screw Kick!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.220
My mirror!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.840
You should've seen the look on your face.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.260
I have plenty of mirrors on my ship!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.480
Bat girl!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:04.690
Shovel Claw!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.320
Sonic!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.540
How dare you attack my Sonic!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:36.510
I wonder what Dark Oak is thinking.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:44.270
We've arrived, sir.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:51.520
I'll give you a big discount.

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:54.650
A 30% to 40% discount is nothing out of the ordinary!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.110
He's frowning.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:10:00.030
Fine, we'll let you ride for free today.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:03.490
He should show respect towards this show's recurring characters.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.830
We've only been on this show four times.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.370
We're extras!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:10.840
You fool! We're just as important as the regulars!

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.460
So where would you like to be dropped off?

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.420
Over there.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.970
Just as you promised, you'll act as the decoy.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.750
Our detective office is gone...

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.960
It's because you just had to have one.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.670
We all knew there would be problems.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.130
But Vector said we had to build it, no matter what.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.050
You fool! That's our symbol!

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.510
We can't call ourselves the Chaotix Detective Agency without an office!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.390
Huh?

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.430
You should at least thank us!

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:10.650
Are you going to rescue Eggman?

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.020
My only target is Dark Oak.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:24.030
I thought that we would make money if we followed that little guy, but we're now in hot water.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.870
That's what you get for giving a lift to that scary guy!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:31.790
I sniffed out a case! That's what a detective does!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.750
Well, let's just help him out!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.760
Yeah, let's help!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.930
Not again...

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:49.180
It's getting noisy.

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.100
Now's the time.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:57.230
Dr. Eggman is calling for help.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:12:02.160
Sonic, we're going into the mothership and rescue Eggman.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.490
Okay, buddy!

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.660
Amy, help Sonic!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.450
Roger!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:10.750
I'll show the Metarex how strong a woman can be when she's in love!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:11.870
Wow...

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.090
Chaos Spear!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.420
Where is he?

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:32.270
You need more training.

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:35.400
Eggman!

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.900
I didn't expect you to rescue me.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.820
Please stand back.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.610
Don't worry about us.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.700
Decoe, Bocoe.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.610
Yes, sir!

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:47.830
It's time to show our stuff!

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.660
Vulcan Merge!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.370
Insert the head!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.080
Fire Decoe-Bocoe Bazooka!

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:01.670
We didn't need your help. We could've escaped anytime we wanted.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:06.840
People shouldn't take us lightly, right, Dr. Eggman?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.800
Thanks for your help, Chris.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.520
Eggman...

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:16.310
I'll cause some trouble before they catch us.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.110
Code verified. Password key granted.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:30.950
I messed with the energy bypass, so it's short-circuiting everywhere.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:32.700
Dr. Eggman, you're smart!

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.510
You let your guard down!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:47.550
We did it!

00:13:48.850 --> 00:13:52.140
How dare you hit my precious face!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:55.100
Rouge, give me your hand!

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.060
What are thinking about at a time like this?

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:59.270
C'mon!

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.480
Hammer!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:06.360
Screw Kick!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.500
Where's Dark Oak?

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.750
He must be over there.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.050
An enemy is approaching the bridge!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.840
Purge everything except the core block.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:26.970
Purge!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.230
What's happening?

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:40.770
We can't stay here much longer!

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:47.990
What?

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:18.270
It's time to end this, Dark Oak!

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.030
There's a huge distortion in the coordinate axis!

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:29.990
The distortion is expanding! What's happening?

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:38.750
When the sleeping land meets the dawn, it will be purified in a haze!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.950
Planet Egg!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:21.660
When the sleeping land meets the dawn, it will be purified in a haze.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:36.140
I see. Once every thousand years, the Galaxy Corridor intersects at this point.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:40.020
That light is from a different universe.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.560
This is bad!

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:47.230
The intersecting point will spread whatever happens here throughout space!

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.480
He was waiting for this moment.

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.650
Sonic!

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.910
All we have to do is defeat Dark Oak, right?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:02.250
I can't allow forestation to happen!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:10.300
What foolish beasts. You still dare fight against the creation of a tranquil universe?

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.770
Planet Egg is water.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.400
Chaos Emerald is light.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.150
They both nurture us.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:35.700
The abundant light and water are the sources of forestation.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.310
I've been waiting a thousand years for this moment.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:14.530
To those who oppose tranquility and order, witness the beginning of forestation!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:18.160
For tranquility and order in the universe!

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:36.650
What's that?

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:40.110
The final stage of forestation has started.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.790
Someone has to stop it!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.790
Everyone, start your attack!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.570
Farewell, White Seed!

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:24.320
Sonic!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.800
The Master Emerald!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.640
That's as far as you go!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.870
Tails! Cosmo!

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:15.920
Amy!

00:21:23.090 --> 00:21:25.720
The Blue Typhoon is also damaged!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:32.770
To the controller of light and the beasts who rely on power...

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:35.060
You are powerless.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:40.940
But there's still time for you to live forever in tranquility and order.

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:46.530
There will be no hate or sadness. It will be an ideal universe.

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:48.530
Sonic!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.540
Is that all you have to say?

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:58.500
Stop, Sonic! If you keep fighting, you'll really die!

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:02.340
I wouldn't like living in such a boring world.

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:05.510
We still want to keep running!

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.350
Then perish!

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:16.560
Sorry, Amy!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:21.770
Sonic!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:27.110
Sonic!

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:54.430
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:54.430
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:54.430
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:49.340
